<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="title">扫描填充 / 复刻</view>
    <view class="muted" style="margin-top:8rpx">
      选一张码的图片，读出它的码制、版本、掩码、纠错级别与配色，再把参数填进生成页；也可以直接把内容识别出来。
    </view>
    <view class="row" style="margin-top:24rpx">
      <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm grow" bindtap="chooseFromAlbum">从相册选图</button>
      <view style="width:16rpx"></view>
      <button class="btn btn-sm grow" bindtap="takePhoto">拍照</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{stage === 'analyzing'}}">
    <view class="card empty">正在分析图片…</view>
  </block>

  <block wx:if="{{stage === 'done'}}">
    <view class="card">
      <view class="row-between">
        <text class="title">解析结果</text>
        <text class="tag" style="color:{{formatColor}};background:{{formatBg}}">{{formatLabel}}</text>
      </view>

      <view class="kv" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="k">
        <text class="k">{{item.k}}</text>
        <text class="v">{{item.v}}</text>
      </view>

      <view class="colors" wx:if="{{analysis.fg}}">
        <view class="color-cell">
          <view class="color-chip" style="background:{{analysis.fg}}"></view>
          <text class="color-text">前景 {{analysis.fg}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="color-cell">
          <view class="color-chip" style="background:{{analysis.bg}}"></view>
          <text class="color-text">背景 {{analysis.bg}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="hint">{{analysis.note}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="title">内容</view>
      <view class="field" style="margin-top:16rpx">
        <textarea
          class="textarea"
          style="min-height:120rpx"
          value="{{content}}"
          placeholder="点下方「识别内容」用同一张图读出内容，或直接手动输入"
          placeholder-class="ph"
          bindinput="onContentInput"
        />
      </view>
      <view class="row">
        <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm grow" bindtap="scanContent">识别内容</button>
        <view style="width:16rpx"></view>
        <button class="btn btn-sm grow" bindtap="copyContent">复制</button>
      </view>
      <view class="hint">小程序无法把「相册里的这张图」直接交给解码器，所以需要你再选一次同一张图片；拍摄实物码时也可以直接对着它扫。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="row-between">
        <text class="title">对比预览</text>
        <text class="muted">左：原图 · 右：按参数重生</text>
      </view>
      <view class="compare">
        <view class="compare-cell">
          <image class="compare-img" src="{{imagePath}}" mode="aspectFit" bindtap="previewImage" />
        </view>
        <view class="compare-cell">
          <canvas type="2d" id="gen" class="compare-canvas" style="background:{{analysis.bg}}"></canvas>
          <view class="compare-tip" wx:if="{{noPreview}}">先填入内容才能重生</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="row" style="margin-bottom:24rpx">
      <button class="btn btn-primary grow" bindtap="applyToGenerate">把参数带到生成页</button>
    </view>
  </block>

  <block wx:if="{{stage === 'fail'}}">
    <view class="card empty">{{failMessage}}</view>
  </block>
</view>

<canvas type="2d" id="work" class="work-canvas"></canvas>
